. 
. xtset program_numeric_id year

Panel variable: program_numeric_id (strongly balan
> ced)
 Time variable: year, 2010 to 2019
         Delta: 1 unit

. 
. * Create urban/rural group based on rural_urban_
> 2010
. * 0 = Urban (RUCA codes 1, 2, 3), 1 = Rural (RUC
> A codes > 3)
. gen urban_rural = (rural_urban_2010 > 3) if !mis
> sing(rural_urban_2010)
(220 missing values generated)

. label define urban_rural_lab 0 "Urban" 1 "Rural"

. label values urban_rural urban_rural_lab

. 
. * Keep only observations with non-missing group
. keep if !missing(urban_rural)
(220 observations deleted)

. 
. * Display basic information
. describe rural_urban_2010 urban_rural

